        "project_health": {
          "before": "Green 6/30/26- Palo Alto has started UAT testing the system and the App. Has decided that they will wait to GoLive once the update to the App is complete in July 2026. 6/11/26- Palo Alto IT Director is working with TSM team to get the Federation Certs set up. It has been assigned to one of their workers at Palo Alto, should have this completed by end of 6/19 per Palo Alto IT.",
          "after": "ON HOLD 10/16/26 Client has decided that they do not want to Go Live with the current EH set up. They want to Golive when the NextGen updates have been made to both CERS and EPL EH. This will be done sometime in 2027 but do not have a date of when this will be finished on CERS side and subsequently completed on EPL side. Client will wait until these updates have been completed before going live. 6/30/26- Palo Alto has started UAT testing the system and the App. Has decided that they will wait to GoLive once the update to the App is complete in July 2026. 6/11/26- Palo Alto IT Director is working with TSM team to get the Federation Certs set up. It has been assigned to one of their workers at Palo Alto, should have this completed by end of 6/19 per Palo Alto IT."
        },
